---
// Footer.astro - GLASTOR® Specter
---

<footer class="bg-slate-950 border-t border-cyber-border/80 py-16 text-slate-400 font-sans">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-10 mb-12">
      <!-- Col 1: Brand -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 sm:gap-3 mb-4 notranslate" translate="no">
          <img src="/images/isologo.webp" alt="GLASTOR® Specter" class="w-8 h-8 sm:w-9 sm:h-9 object-contain shrink-0" />
          <div class="flex flex-col justify-center text-left">
            <span class="font-display font-black text-base sm:text-lg tracking-tight text-white leading-none">
              GLASTOR®
            </span>
            <span class="font-mono text-[9px] sm:text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#00ff9d] uppercase leading-none mt-1">
              RUST ENGINEERING
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 max-w-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          Zero-Compiler Polyglot AST API Contract Differ, Trojan Breaking-Change Guard & Mathematical SemVer Gatekeeper in Rust.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-cyber-card border border-cyber-border text-cyber-cyan">v1.0.0</span>
          <span>MIT Licensed</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>Rust Edition 2024</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Resources -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-white text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Resources</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/marketplace/actions/glastor-specter-polyglot-ast-api-contract-semver-gatekeeper" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-cyber-cyan transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined notranslate text-sm" translate="no" aria-hidden="true">store</span>
              <span>GitHub Marketplace</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://crates.io/crates/specter-cli" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-cyber-cyan transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined notranslate text-sm" translate="no" aria-hidden="true">package_2</span>
              <span>crates.io (specter-cli)</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/glastor-core/specter" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-cyber-cyan transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined notranslate text-sm" translate="no" aria-hidden="true">code</span>
              <span>Source Repository</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/glastor-core/homebrew-tap" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-cyber-cyan transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined notranslate text-sm" translate="no" aria-hidden="true">local_cafe</span>
              <span>Homebrew Tap</span>
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Ecosystem -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-white text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">GLASTOR® Core</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/glastor-core/pii-veil" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-cyber-cyan transition-colors">
              pii-veil (PII & Secrets Engine)
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/glastor-core/nemesis" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-cyber-cyan transition-colors">
              nemesis (SAST Governance)
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/glastor-core/vortex" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-cyber-cyan transition-colors">
              vortex (AST Pre-Build Sharding)
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/glastor-core/byte-gauge" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-cyber-cyan transition-colors">
              byte-gauge (SIMD Binary Auditor)
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/glastor-core/medusa" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-cyber-cyan transition-colors">
              medusa (Zero-Trust Edge Gateway)
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Legal & Corporate Compliance Bar -->
    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-cyber-border/60 text-xs text-slate-400">
      <div class="space-y-1.5 leading-relaxed font-sans">
        <p class="text-slate-200 font-medium">
          © 2010-2026 GLASTOR®. Todos los derechos reservados.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-400">
          Marca registrada ante el INPI (Reg. 4559568 y 4559567).
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-400">
          Los precios están expresados en moneda local e incluyen IVA.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-400 font-mono text-[11px]">
          CUIT 23-25316566-9 | Resp. Inscripto | IB: Convenio Multilateral
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-400 font-mono text-[11px]">
          GLASTOR® Core & Enterprise Engineering | v.1.0.0 • Exclusivo B2B / Pagos por Transferencia.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
